7niw|v|To come to life; to become alive; to become vivified or enlivened; hence, to exhibit signs of life; to move, as the fetus in the womb. ; To move with rapidity or activity; to become accelerated; as, his pulse quickened.	o:4k56,55,1;8x5y,51,14;8x71,37,2;2drz,4,1~8x5y,51,14;8x71,37,2;2drz,4,1;4k56,55,1	d:axy,19,64~axy,19,64	D:8x5y,13,1~8x5y,13,1
